{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_142_1000_se", "source_sha256": "95e4be3e57394fdd121b26210aa8c9c34c0fd3228413fcd7d9c90f196a284a0e", "ja": "バターン！", "zh": "砰——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_142_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "389f8f541dbc7e4908fc5e3ce94a24336cce6f2b1761700b6cf6865af6d08919", "ja": "そんなに落ち込まないで、まこりん！　泣いても、\n{$P$}ちゃんは帰ってこないよ！", "zh": "别那么消沉，真！就算哭了，{$P$}也不会回来的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_142_1002_009rit", "source_sha256": "50f0b41d7ee481031673ac7ac8cb5e4d03cbe852b4c2a2a650cb1f58525e3767", "ja": "そうよ、真。\nそれに今回のことは、真のせいじゃないわ。", "zh": "对啊，真。\n而且这次的事情也不是你的错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_142_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "3c83794382f5b1ae237fc11b3cec62d05abf1afc570176176e4d33c4915a3282", "ja": "茜、律子……でも……！", "zh": "茜，律子……可是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_142_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "721035a670d79c4ab43cc6a8647331bdc66d28195f4271120ef8ac37d823ebcb", "ja": "せやで、真！　落ち込んでもしゃあない。\nこういう時こそ、前向きに行かなアカン！", "zh": "就是这样，真！消沉也没用。\n正是这种时候，更要积极向前才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_142_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "e1f8d37784c681446504a5d07fffe2f3a8069cec4354d8edaef1e1c94d0eb1f3", "ja": "でも、まさか{$P$}くんが\nあんなことになるなんてね……。", "zh": "不过，没想到{$P$}先生会变成那样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_142_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "c4134f1cb5cbd17afc042c3bd3003f64bbdc38d876a0e30cdf72e309b5514aca", "ja": "ええ……。予想もしていませんでした。\nまさか、{$P$}が……。", "zh": "是啊……完全没想到。\n没想到，{$P$}竟然……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_142_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "2774a4a2689047d0da5dec0e6cd9d6adce4f4622ed3f9c9f1f7ff262caf024c2", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。きっと\n命がけで、アイドルをかばったんですよね。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……。一定是拼上性命保护了偶像吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_142_1008_046rio", "source_sha256": "c6b82ba22b8a45c685475857c33fd2bd7bb8500015f0e8dc18110ccdd47d51fa", "ja": "だからって、あんなのの前に飛び出すだなんて！\n{$P$}くんは、バカよ……！", "zh": "就算这样，也不能冲到那种东西面前去啊！\n{$P$}，你真是个笨蛋……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_142_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "4c8f6eb34f51252a0723aca631d15b9779cfe31bbdf70ae7c845f91cd9eaef59", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん……\n君のアイドルへの愛は、本物だったよ……！", "zh": "{$P$}……\n你对偶像的爱，是真的呢……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_142_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "8b3c9ca17a977e611c1350fcdbb8e93939b6311416761ab21eaaa9e99c5cdeb7", "ja": "うう……{$P$}の……\n{$P$}の、バカーッ！！！", "zh": "呜呜……{$P$}的……  \n{$P$}的，大笨蛋——！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_142_1012_006mak", "source_sha256": "e18863c632ee5ab2fe4bca6027d5decbf417938028089cc122d5c9bd4913ee4d", "ja": "……っていう夢を見たんです！　しかも今朝！\n起きる瞬間に！", "zh": "我做了这样的梦！而且还是今天早上！\n就在醒来的瞬间！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_142_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "012b1253b303237f19eeca9c6b3ea7ffe5df468158978ef7cec45cff938db376", "ja": "朝見る夢は、正夢になるっていうじゃないですか！\n危険ですよ！", "zh": "早上做的梦会成真，不是有这种说法吗！\n太危险了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_142_1014_p", "source_sha256": "57fc263eaef33ed220350430bd5610f413575ed0cb10fe5bf5fbff978db1aa10", "ja": "お、おお。そうだったのか。\nそれは、大変だったな……？", "zh": "哦、哦哦。原来是这样啊。\n那可真是够呛的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_142_1015_006mak", "source_sha256": "940988816526c825f8e35d447317bfd5a2b7f584d99a411d9c30c1c0407dc00b", "ja": "{$P$}！\nもっと危機感を持ってください！", "zh": "{$P$}！\n请你再多有点危机感啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_142_1016_p", "source_sha256": "a59ae318c486466bbaf56f71be2391739350f95f1e8f01f54f4526066cb89f46", "ja": "わかった。でも、そうそう\nドラゴンに襲われる事はないと思うけど……。", "zh": "我知道了。不过，我觉得一般\n不会那么容易遭到巨龙袭击吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_142_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "68fe62d8e3f3697063d7569a676929ef4f4cf986fddf7c975619f82d08821019", "ja": "{$P$}……ボクのこと疑ってますね？\n大丈夫です！　ボク、空手習ってましたから！", "zh": "{$P$}……你是在怀疑我吧？\n没关系！我以前学过空手道！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_142_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "90de295c80d873a1175d03d760cdcf84af67910c3574fc18344cb5ddbea01385", "ja": "いざとなったら、この拳を使ってでも……！\nハーッ！", "zh": "真到了紧急关头，就算用上这双拳头我也……！\n哈——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_142_1019_p", "source_sha256": "4884b377bc4aa98fb3ea2dcaed087109be01040ea1d930132a92bacf3814aa41", "ja": "うん、知ってる。\nでも大丈夫だよ、劇場には警備員さんもいるし……。", "zh": "嗯，我知道。\n不过没事的，剧场里也有保安在……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_142_1020_p", "source_sha256": "6e7af385d4077b943d1e558db64afd186284da77c8969ca07125ac856aacc5b4", "ja": "そもそも、真は大事なアイドルだからな。\nそんな危ない事はさせられないよ。", "zh": "说到底，真可是很重要的偶像。\n这种危险的事，不能让你去做。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_142_1021_006mak", "source_sha256": "919ea74ed78b3bec646352a1d788d8ba1c9a257d78da6d489641b5ebbf94b06b", "ja": "えっ。だ、大事なアイドル、ですか？\nえへ、えへへへ……♪", "zh": "诶。重、重要的偶像……是吗？\n嘿嘿，嘿嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_142_1022_006mak", "source_sha256": "86655d012659be30c44b86cfc6daa3b1c194f5dcec9f4dc4c78e82deaae8df9b", "ja": "ハッ！　誤魔化されませんよ！？", "zh": "哈！我才不会被你糊弄过去呢！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_142_1023_p", "source_sha256": "3b64a67d627e1b31a61c2245989070d95cf2b0cc941e8928c9ac1a0352904f94", "ja": "（ダメだったか……）", "zh": "（果然不行吗……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_142_1024_p", "source_sha256": "c94fbed9ffdf524b157f2d3cb8079b1ca100af69db0021298fc580cacb1d91a2", "ja": "とにかく、そろそろ移動の時間だ。\nみんなもう駐車場に来てるだろうし、行こう！", "zh": "总之，差不多该出发了。\n大家应该已经到停车场了，我们走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_142_1025_006mak", "source_sha256": "6c2dac4fe5e53186dae229526a9009514dd996124e286cbc3a8b14c646aa2668", "ja": "うーっ。とにかく、{$P$}、\n今日一日気をつけてくださいね！", "zh": "呜——总之，{$P$}，今天一天请多加小心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_142_1026_p", "source_sha256": "4b9456842acb46ec6641b111765fe6a4fbfd1ddc201a64db64b7cb37b7702d4b", "ja": "ああ、わかったよ。\n心配してくれてありがとう、真！", "zh": "啊，知道了。\n谢谢你为我担心，真！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_142_1027_p", "source_sha256": "5fcf3334195682704ff0deae5b52c2ed158343febed35ddf3d6a49adb28ac03b", "ja": "それにしても、夢か……夢違いだな……。", "zh": "不过话说回来，梦吗……还真是截然不同的梦啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_142_1028_p", "source_sha256": "514e859185451d1ec79a0ae9afa0d3f196eb4fa49eb492cb6ceaebc6690bc113", "ja": "（今日真達が出演する番組の事前アンケートは、\n『将来の夢について』という内容だった）", "zh": "（今天真她们要出演的节目，事前问卷的内容是“关于将来的梦想”）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_142_1029_p", "source_sha256": "675141d287d2a4ee7535bf3564100c8e706b160c7a366fdfe790cd912f4fc6b4", "ja": "（事前アンケートの回答について、真と少し話そうと\n思ってたんだけど……時間がなくなっちゃったな）", "zh": "（本来想就事前问卷的回答和真稍微聊聊的……但没时间了啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
